{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1789957531,"nonce":"bqx+/9tVkBj2v60pIzb3s/CXARs=","title":"Python: a module function passed as a value keeps dynamic parameters (spectral-norm is 20x behind PyPy)","message":"`ZYNTAX_TRACE_TYPES=1 zypy run spectral-norm.py -n 1` prints\n\n    eval_A(i: Object, j: Object) -\u003e Object\n    eval_times_u(func: Object, u: Object) -\u003e List(Object)\n    part_A_times_u(i_u: Object) -\u003e Object\n    part_At_times_u(i_u: Object) -\u003e Object\n    main(n: Object) -\u003e List(Float)\n\nso every operation of the kernel is dynamic: `func((i, u))` goes\nthrough `zb_call_1` with a boxed tuple, `for j, u_j in enumerate(u)`\nsnapshots an Object with `zb_any_iter` and boxes every element, and\n`eval_A` does boxed arithmetic. Under load: 80 ms per iteration against\nPyPy 3.7 ms.\n\nCause: `types::closed_items` treats a module function that is referenced\nas a value (`eval_times_u(part_A_times_u, u)`) as open, so its unannotated\nparameters settle to Object; and the parameter `func` that receives it is\ntyped Object, so the call `func((i, u))` records no argument types for\nanyone. `main` is passed to `util.run_benchmark`, so `n` is Object too.\n\nFix: a callee-set type for a parameter that only ever receives module\nfunctions (or closures) of one arity, `Ty::Funcs(set index)` next to\n`Ty::Closure(k)`: every value flowing into it is a known function, a\ncall through it is a switch on the record's code address over direct\ntyped calls (or one direct call when the set has one member), and each\nmember's parameters are joined from the calls through the set, the way\n`Target::Closure` records them in `Calls`. A member remains closed as\nlong as every value use of it flows into such a parameter or a local of\nthat type; anything else (stored in a container, returned to a dynamic\ncaller) opens it as today.\n\nThis is the whole of spectral-norm's gap; the iteration costs behind it\n(enumerate over Object, `len(list(u))`, `izip`) are in a253f9f.","files":null}]}